WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.941
A visitor has three minutes
before the next session.

00:00:03.344 --> 00:00:05.034
What would make them stop at your booth,

00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:07.836
understand your offer
and remember it tomorrow?

00:00:08.096 --> 00:00:09.222
Start with the message.

00:00:09.626 --> 00:00:14.612
We translate your visual identity
into backdrops, large booths, signage

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:18.747
and demonstration spaces that people
can navigate from the trade show aisle.

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:20.599
Then we plan the interaction.

00:00:21.003 --> 00:00:22.624
Where does the conversation start?

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.066
Who runs the demo?

00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:27.349
How does a promising introduction
reach your sales team?

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:29.972
Behind the scenes we select fabrication,

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.268
multimedia, staffing
and logistics partners,

00:00:33.529 --> 00:00:36.812
with décor and catering
when the experience calls for them.

00:00:37.072 --> 00:00:41.152
We bring the practical experience
of more than two hundred and fifty small

00:00:41.165 --> 00:00:44.242
and midsize events alongside
our corporate productions.

00:00:44.646 --> 00:00:49.288
We coordinate install, rehearsals,
live execution and breakdown.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.651
When we produce the full corporate event,

00:00:52.131 --> 00:00:55.620
our digital system is included
for the event and future use.

00:00:56.024 --> 00:01:00.103
Bring us the floor plan, your audience
and the action you want them to take.
